<title>BRAZIL: Sabesp first half net rises.</title>
<headline>Sabesp first half net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo state sewage company Sabesp issued the following statement on its first half results.</p>
<p>			   1997	     1996</p>
<p>    Net		 83.059 million     25.338 million</p>
<p>    Net oper revs   1.36 bln	  1.12 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>The company said a 228 percent increase in its first half earnings is mostly due to cost control and a 9.8 percent hike in water and sewage rates. It also said it gained market share after it was granted concessions to operate in three new municipalities.</p>
<p>The company now serves 350 municipalities in Sao Paulo state.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
